  "description": "Introducing The Method 750 — where raw BMX heritage meets electrified muscle. Designed by Crew Bike Co, this 29” big wheel e-BMX delivers a perfect blend of street style, performance, and power for riders who demand more from every ride.\nAt its core is a 750W rear hub motor pushing out 85N·m of torque, capable of reaching speeds up to 35 MPH in OCEV mode. A 48V 14.5Ah lithium-ion battery powers your ride with up to 35 miles of range via pedal assist, and the 4-mode controller (Eco, Sport, Race, Offroad) adapts to your flow—whether you're ripping pavement, cruising the boardwalk, or hitting that next takeover.\nBuilt around a durable 6061 alloy frame and a chromoly BMX fork, The Method 750 stays true to its BMX roots. Outfitted with Crew MK-4 4-piece chromoly bars, a 175mm chromoly crankset, and ultra-grippy 29” x 3.0” Crew Takeover tires, this ride doesn’t just perform—it dominates.\nHydraulic disc brakes with oversized rotors (180mm front / 160mm rear) provide all the stopping power you need, while the included full-knurled steel pegs and padded BMX saddle round out this street-ready machine.",
